    <!-- Agreement -->
    <string name="agreement_updated">Updated: %1$s</string>
    <string-array name="agreement_titles">
        <item>1. Services</item><item>2. Account &amp; Identity</item><item>3. Work Standards</item>
        <item>4. Customer Data Protection</item><item>5. Fees &amp; Settlement</item><item>6. Breach</item><item>7. Changes</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="agreement_bodies">
        <item>The platform provides technicians with end-to-end services including order dispatch, on-site work, scan-to-bind, photo reporting, activation and sign-off. Technicians shall complete on-site work within the scheduled time and report truthfully.</item>
        <item>Joining requires your real name, phone number and ID number, subject to platform review. Accounts are for personal use only and must not be lent or shared.</item>
        <item>Technicians shall follow safety regulations and wear required protective equipment. Report abnormalities (missing device, customer refusal, wrong address) via the App immediately; never resell or dispose of customer devices.</item>
        <item>Customer names, addresses and phone numbers encountered during work are confidential and may only be used for the current order.</item>
        <item>Fees are settled per the platform\'s published pricing. Charges must be completed online via the App; no off-platform charges.</item>
        <item>Fraudulent reporting, unauthorized charging, data leakage or malicious complaints may result in suspension or termination, and the platform reserves the right to claim damages.</item>
        <item>The platform may revise this agreement and will notify via in-app notices; continued use constitutes acceptance.</item>
    </string-array>

